      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
